WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:01.440
Long live Prince of Jin

00:01.520 --> 00:02.640
Long live Prince of Jin

00:02.720 --> 00:03.800
Long live Prince of Jin

00:03.960 --> 00:05.160
Long live Prince of Jin

00:05.240 --> 00:07.040
Long live Prince of Jin

00:09.680 --> 00:10.800
Zhu Yuanzhi

00:10.880 --> 00:11.880
Here

00:11.960 --> 00:13.320
You lead Beishuo Army

00:13.400 --> 00:14.400
Prepare meals at third watch

00:14.480 --> 00:15.640
Break camp at fifth watch

00:15.720 --> 00:17.040
Before dawn

00:17.120 --> 00:18.080
Cross Tianhe

00:18.160 --> 00:19.560
Yes

00:21.240 --> 00:22.120
Xie Xuan

00:22.200 --> 00:23.400
Here

00:23.480 --> 00:24.960
Seal all military news

00:25.640 --> 00:26.680
Today's events

00:26.760 --> 00:28.427
Must not leak at all

00:28.640 --> 00:29.720
Otherwise

00:29.800 --> 00:31.200
Military law will be enforced

00:31.280 --> 00:32.680
Yes

00:36.360 --> 00:37.600
Your Highness

00:37.680 --> 00:40.040
We still need to cover up with Prince Ning

00:40.120 --> 00:42.040
I'll imitate Chen Ying's handwriting

00:42.280 --> 00:43.400
Reply to Prince Ning

00:43.480 --> 00:45.400
Try to lull them

00:47.280 --> 00:48.400
Good

00:48.480 --> 00:50.360
The longer we delay, the better

00:57.480 --> 00:58.880
Success

00:58.960 --> 01:00.480
General Chen sent word

01:01.720 --> 01:03.120
It's done

01:04.640 --> 01:06.040
I congratulate Your Highness

01:06.200 --> 01:07.600
Prepare to ascend immediately

01:07.960 --> 01:09.320
Qingzhou Army

01:09.400 --> 01:10.800
Let them return first

01:11.200 --> 01:11.560
I

01:11.720 --> 01:13.387
Will do it right away

01:16.200 --> 01:17.600
Or

01:18.000 --> 01:20.120
Have Qingzhou Army approach first

01:20.960 --> 01:22.080
Everything

01:22.160 --> 01:24.160
Wait until after ascending the throne

01:25.160 --> 01:26.560
Right, right

01:27.400 --> 01:28.800
Safety first

01:43.520 --> 01:44.920
Your Highness

01:46.200 --> 01:47.080
Who?

01:47.160 --> 01:48.040
It's me

01:48.200 --> 01:49.600
Liu Nian

01:49.720 --> 01:51.120
Uncle Qiu said

01:51.200 --> 01:53.720
Your Highness's heart must be troubled tonight

01:54.000 --> 01:54.880
I thought

01:54.960 --> 01:56.627
I'd come see Your Highness

